Package: metagenealign
Type: Package
Title: Cross-Cohort Latent Transcriptional Program Discovery
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Zhaiyue", "Xu", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "xzy1234560809@163.com")
Description: Outcome-agnostic framework for discovering recurrent latent
    transcriptional programs across independent transcriptomic cohorts. Each
    cohort is decomposed independently with stabilized independent component
    analysis; cross-cohort reciprocal best hits and Markov clustering define
    recurrent metagene communities. Unique-unit recurrence, unit-balanced
    consensus loadings, post-hoc gene-set annotation, and explicit human review
    gates provide a reusable workflow. The package combines established methods
    and does not claim a novel matrix-factorization algorithm.
